# Code, service-account key, encrypted caches, logs and .htpasswd live here: never served over HTTP.
# The deny sits inside <If> on purpose: Apache merges <If> sections after every directory/.htaccess section,
# so the root .htaccess's <If ...> Require valid-user would otherwise override a plain "Require all denied"
# here. A nested <If> is merged later still.
Require all denied
<If "true">
    Require all denied
</If>
